object: glow | decision | Glow-in-the-dark material | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[rubbery latex,plastic]
object: battery | decision | Battery type | outcome:enum[rechargeable,kinetic,conventional]
object: charging_stand | decision | Charging stand | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse

